48
00:08:11,839 --> 00:08:26,648
[Host] That's all for today. Two tiny twins, born at half the usual size, are now more than double their birth weight and will soon meet their fans at the zoo. If you visit Yokohama this summer, maybe you can see them too. See you next time!

